                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The module describes the primary production of cadmium metal (99.9%) on a global average. No secondary sources from post consumer scrap are considered. Only the most important source, the cadmium sludges from hydrometallurgical zinc operations, is reflected with the dataset. For the use in applications where cadmium is a major constituent – e.g. in NiCd battery systems – the dataset should be complemented with additional specific emission factors and the secondary production process.;
CAS number: 007440-43-9; 
Formula: Cd; 
UUID: 7f656f5c-03d0-3716-bb6b-184bdcf2379c</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
        <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
            <referenceToReferenceFlow>1</referenceToReferenceFlow>
        </quantitativeReference>
        <time xmlns:olca="http://openlca.org/ilcd-extensions" olca:startDate="1104534000000" olca:endDate="1133391600000">
